  "description": "Amendments to planning permission dated 30 July 2024 (RN: 24/02160/FULL) for, \"Comprehensive refurbishment of the buildings, in connection with use of all of the upper floors as office accommodation (Use Class E), erection of a setback rooftop extension, and a double mansard extension with new dormer windows to the Glasshouse Street elevation including new amenity terraces; alterations to Glasshouse Street chimneys and new plant equipment and screening; external alterations to Glasshouse Street facades including new retail shopfront, new office reception entrance and glazing, new service entrance and associated works; internal alterations including enlargement of the office reception at ground floor, infilling the atrium to provide additional office accommodation (Use Class E) at first floor, and the relocation of the goods corridor on the ground floor; and other associated works\"; NAMELY: (i) Infilling of an existing first-floor window within the approved internal courtyard/atrium, including removal of the existing window frame and infilling the opening with matching brickwork; and (ii) Amendment to the wording of Condition 6 to substitute a revised drawings number showing the location of the waste and recycling store.",
